DATABASE: “It is a place or medium which is used to store the data in Systematic and organized manner”.

Why do we have to store data in systematic and organized manner?

EX: LIBRARY

    



In above example we can see the arrangement of books in the library in two methods. One is in organized manner and another one is in unorganized manner.
When books are arranged systematically (e.g., by category, author, or title), it becomes easier for readers to locate the books they need. Librarians and visitors can quickly find and return books when there is a structured system in place.
In an unorganized setup, finding a specific book can be frustrating and time-consuming. An unorganized collection leads to wasted time searching for misplaced books.
Same way when it comes to database if the data is stored in a systematic way then it will be easy to access the data based on the requirement.

