LET’S WRITE A QUERY FOR THIS QUESTION BY USING BETWEEN OPERATOR
	SELECT *
	FROM EMP
	WHERE SAL BETWEEN 2000 AND 5000;
NOTE: Since BETWEEN operator is an Inclusive operator, means it will 
   include the boundary values also.

In the above Example, along with the values which falls between 2000 & 5000 it’ll include both 2000 & 5000. If we don’t want 2000 & 5000, we want only the values from 2001 to 4999 then we have to increase the lower range by 1 and decrease the higher range by 1.

	SELECT *
	FROM EMP
	WHERE SAL BETWEEN 2001 AND 4999;

Now it’ll include the values from 2001 and 4999 and display the final output.



